  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A stationary wave is established in a pipe closed at one end. The frequencies of three consecutive resonances are measured and recorded in the table below.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Resonance</th><th>Frequency / Hz</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>First measured</td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"450\"></span></td></tr><tr><td>Second measured</td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"750\"></span></td></tr><tr><td>Third measured</td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1050\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What is the fundamental frequency of the pipe?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"150\\text{ Hz}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"225\\text{ Hz}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"300\\text{ Hz}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"450\\text{ Hz}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
  },
